WEBVTT

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:09.025
In a world... where paperwork vanishes.

00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:11.938
One signature... can unleash chaos.

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:15.559
The Bad.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.625
But one mistake... was only the beginning.

00:00:18.650 --> 00:00:20.369
The paperwork? Gone.

00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:23.489
The Ugly.

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:27.362
When all hope seemed lost... someone did the impossible.

00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:28.905
They checked the delivery.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.928
They followed... the procedure.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:38.923
Three choices. One stockroom. Zero excuses.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.887
The Good. The Bad. The Ugly.
